  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PADEO 2.0 Systems Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon has been struggling amidst a web of economic and political crises that rapidly worsened since late 2019 and led to raging unemployment and hyperinflation. Lebanon&#x2019;s limited internal production capacity and economy which was largely built around the services sector, resulted in a major trade deficit and heavy reliance on imports.Following a recent mapping of Lebanon&#x2019;s key productive sectors, this project serves to analyse the country&#x2019;s agro-food sector to inform the Netherlands on existing bottlenecks and critical leverage points, which may be addressed with Dutch expertise and investments to unlock new jobs and economic growth in Lebanon&#x2019;s agro-food sector.</narrative>
  </description>
